<title>SINGAPORE: Vikay Industrial 96 net falls 95.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Vikay Industrial 96 net falls 95.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				0.10 vs  2.13</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		    1.75 vs  2.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     0.07 vs  1.75</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)   0.14 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Turnover				 96.52 vs 91.42</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.71 vs  0.07</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    5.57 vs  3.79</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		4.95 vs  3.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  0.44 vs  2.23</p>
<p>    Tax					 0.34 vs  0.07</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil  vs  0.02 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Vikay Industrial Ltd is an electronic manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
